@ seconds left -> countdown bar and seconds drawn into PICT at y=48 (one REPL)
\<< \-> left
  \<<
    PICT { #0d #48d }
    #131d #8d BLANK
    IF left 0 > THEN { #2d #2d } left 3 * R\->B #4d BLANK NEG REPL END
    left \->STR "s" + 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
    REPL
  \>>
\>>
